# GENOMETRICS — core agent context

Product: **GENOMETRICS** by Bruno Omena. Monolith: `backend/` (Spring Boot) + `frontend/` (Angular SPA).

## Read first

- Full map, commands, and coprogramming rules: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)
- Backend conventions: `.cursor/rules/backend.mdc` (auto when editing `backend/**`)
- Frontend conventions: `.cursor/rules/frontend.mdc` (auto when editing `frontend/**`)

## GitHub Flow

- **`main`** only long-lived branch; PRs from `feature/*`, `fix/*`, `hotfix/*`
- CI (`backend`, `frontend`, `e2e`) must pass before merge
- Do not commit/push unless the user asks; no direct pushes to `main`

## Agent defaults

- Smallest diff; English for UI/API/docs
- Auth **disabled in dev** (`ngs.auth.disabled`, `environment.authDisabled`)
- Business logic in `FastqParser`, `VcfParser`, `AnalysisService` — not in Angular pages
- Cloud/local agents: H2 only (`mvn spring-boot:run`); no Docker/Compose unless user requests prod
- After implementation, invoke `/verifier`; on failures, `/debugger`

## Avoid

Unrequested refactors, new layers, duplicate FE/BE logic, large docs, force-push to `main`.
